  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 268 * 4 * 8 * 5 * 14 = 41\n\nAccording to the question, by replacing the *signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + × − ÷ \n\n268 + 4 × 8 − **5 ÷ 14**__ = 41\n\n268 + __**4 **____**×**____** 8**__ − 0.35 = 41\n\n__**268 + 32**__ - 0.35 = 41\n\n__**300 - 0.35**__ = 41\n\n299.65 ≠ 41 (LHS ≠ RHS) \n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × ÷ + − \n\n268 × **4 ÷ 8**__ + 5 − 14 = 41\n\n__**268 **____**× 0.5**__ + 5 - 14 = 41\n\n__**134 + 5**__ - 14 = 41\n\n__**139 - 14**__ = 41\n\n125 ≠ 41 (LHS ≠ RHS) \n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ × + −\n\n**268 ÷ 4**__ × 8 + 5 − 14 = 41\n\n__**67 ×**____** 8**__ + 5 − 14 = 41\n\n__**536 + 5 **__- 14 = 41\n\n__**541 - 14**__ = 41\n\n527 ≠ 41 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ − × +\n\n**268 ÷ 4**__ − 8 × 5 + 14 = 41\n\n67 − __**8 **____**×**____** 5**__ + 14 = 41\n\n__**67 + 14**__ - 40 = 41\n\n__**81 - 40**__ = 41\n\n41 = 41 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
